{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ef6c150229566405096d3e827be302388eefaf2eef590465a8bc794705a5a1d", "ja": "（特設ステージでのバレンタインライブは大盛況！\nファンに向けた、最高のプレゼントになったな）", "zh": "（特别舞台上的情人节演出大获成功！这一定成了送给粉丝们的最佳礼物）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b1117ffaa2aba87fe74c20a03476a6a6186cab6ac86ce1f94ce629f9b38bf28b", "ja": "貴音、お疲れ様！　いいステージだったぞ。", "zh": "贵音，辛苦了！刚才的舞台很棒啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "35507571f82bbe9f44e77d38cec682e4f472fd3e0ae078d7a47bcdb7c93538b8", "ja": "ありがとうございます。私も、楽しい時間を\n過ごせました。少々、困ったこともありましたが……。", "zh": "非常感谢。我也度过了一段\n愉快的时光。虽然也遇到了一点小困扰……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9252eae948332ce28246dce888a307fa4097652448a6e2401e52c1a1001bbda1", "ja": "うん？　困ったこと？", "zh": "嗯？困扰你的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "6bd44c83538e9e6d1d3bf7380f578cf2e7343341a839fd85a481f2c90f041ef0", "ja": "はい。数々のちょこに囲まれたステージ……\nその甘き誘惑に、お腹が空いてきてしまいまして。", "zh": "是的。置身于各式各样的巧克力环绕的舞台……\n那甜蜜的诱惑，让我不由得感到饥饿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1451a89e88fc79c0101abdeec6fb4127b9ecdbbefb89816170344343c92ac732", "ja": "なるほど、セットのチョコか……あ、そう言えば。\nファンから、チョコの差し入れがあったな。", "zh": "原来如此，是布景用的巧克力啊……啊，说起来。\n粉丝还送过巧克力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "718397cee5dc74dc98c43d66e22b066da08a440a48f52b6fffbaeeefd1edd286", "ja": "なんと……！\n真、嬉しい贈り物です。", "zh": "没想到……！\n真是令人开心的礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a49636bc44470047de3e67108393fc33e9400416fa9ca92ae9553bff32663b32", "ja": "でも、思ったより量が多くて。\nさすがの貴音も、食べきれるかどうか……。", "zh": "不过，分量比想象中还多。\n就连贵音也不知道能不能吃完……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "8b7f4d168ad6fe0d5c956be327a31dc005016a534f11c201b1cc6f0113a4eff3", "ja": "ご心配には及びません。ちょこであれば、\nどれほど多くとも、今宵のうちに完食できましょう。", "zh": "不必担心。若是巧克力，无论有多少，我今晚都能全部吃完。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "4fe1375e8df100b648ac55c8d0834a69304eb381742e8780107be7472f99fab4", "ja": "それに……私のことを思って、\nファンの皆様が贈ってくださったのですから。", "zh": "而且……这是粉丝们为我着想送来的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "8faaa2fbaf08d7213c95ac47aae555651c8e32f3284a2d7d3fff7e3df0027907", "ja": "残すなど、もってのほか。\nすべて、心ゆくまで堪能させていただきます。", "zh": "更别说要留下来了，简直不可理喻。\n我会把这些全都尽情享用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1011_p", "source_sha256": "52ee52faab4da1aa47a37b149bf33ee2a2efc32c3dac5865208195ed352d6f53", "ja": "そうか。まあ、気持ちはわかるよ。俺も\n貴音にたくさんチョコを貰った時に、そう思ったから。", "zh": "这样啊。嗯，我能理解你的心情。我也是在收到\n贵音送来的很多巧克力时，有过同样的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "5bf31811d050a0689ce0c9ad13dd8d83c5478fb952543e0141df5525a6bcca41", "ja": "あれは……{$P$}のお口に合う\nものを探していたのですが、どれも大変美味で……。", "zh": "那是……我本想寻找合{$P$}口味的\n东西，可无论哪种都极其美味……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "f354dc9a5d5492152e94334fa204384123e605167f6836ee43cb12c9efd7ab20", "ja": "結局、全部お贈りしてしまいました。\n邪魔になっていませんか？", "zh": "结果不知不觉就把全部都送给您了。没有给您添麻烦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1014_p", "source_sha256": "145e7c214614bbb369b42ef80f66bb3dc07ee7724f3223bec650059629473f67", "ja": "とんでもない。凄く嬉しかったよ。少し時間は掛かると\n思うけど、美味しく食べさせてもらうから。", "zh": "怎么会。真的特别开心。虽然我想可能要花点时间，  \n但我会好好享用的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "6eaaa70c6ec5b615ff3f7ee5fdc276373bbc8a9e90ebde6d8abd3278eca76f45", "ja": "まあ……ふふっ。今こそ、\nファンの気持ちが、わかるような気が致します。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵。此时此刻，\n我仿佛体会到了粉丝们的心情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "f2d1036ab3cb56e9e23a72f7632212661535f79e783bdfd7e1eae32ec7bca533", "ja": "蕩けるように、甘い気持ちの行き交う日……。\nばれんたいんとは、真、素敵な行事ですね。", "zh": "这是一个让甜蜜得令人心醉的心意彼此交汇的日子……情人节真是个美好的节日呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0243_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "a44087d2e7f5379d9d376fe077929e38b70fbd6300d01798a43bcd675d0b4ba0", "ja": "私の気持ちを、全て受け止めてくださって……。\nありがとうございます、あなた様♪", "zh": "您愿意全盘接受我的心意……\n谢谢您，您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
